<title>USA: ATHLETICS-U.S. CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-U.S. CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals on the</p>
<p>second day of the five-day U.S. athletics championships on</p>
<p>Thursday at Indiana Track Stadium.</p>
<p>Heptathlon</p>
<p> 1. Kelly Blair     6,465 points</p>
<p> 2. DeDee Nathan    6,317</p>
<p> 3. Kym Carter	6,289</p>
<p>Decathlon</p>
<p> 1. Steve Fritz	8,604</p>
<p> 2. Chris Huffins    8,458</p>
<p> 3. Shawn Wilbourn   8,268</p>
<p>Men's shot</p>
<p> 1. Randy Barnes	22.03 metres</p>
<p> 2. Kevin Toth	  21.78</p>
<p> 3. C.J. Hunter	 21.34</p>
<p>Women's shot</p>
<p>1. Connie Price-Smith  19.06</p>
<p> 2. Valeyta Althouse    18.60</p>
<p> 3. Tressa Thompson     17.73</p>
<p>Note: Top three finishers in each final qualify for U.S.</p>
<p>team for world championships</p>
